     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tobacco control governance supported in 14 countries, as part of the FCTC 2030 project, among them Cabo Verde, Cambodia, Chad, Colombia, El Salvador, Georgia, Jordan, Madagascar, Myanmar, Samoa, Sierra Leone and Sri Lanka. 
Investment cases completed for all 15 phase I countries, and nine additional countries have jointed the project as phase II countries. 

National capacities on implementation of Article 5A strengthened through a joint training held with WHO/PAHO and the WHO FCTC Secretariat for LMICs in the WHO Region of the Americas.</narrative>
